sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as SRE / Platform Admin
    participant CLI as tenant-manager CLI
    participant Validator as Pre-Flight Validator
    participant TxManager as Transaction Manager
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API Server
    participant Cluster as Tenant Pods (WebUI + LiteLLM)

    Admin->>CLI: tenant-manager provision tenants/examples/acme-corp.yaml
    CLI->>Validator: Validate Schema, DNS, BYOK Credentials, Budget & LDAPS Syntax
    alt Validation Failure
        Validator-->>CLI: Validation Error (e.g. invalid subdomain format or missing credentials)
        CLI-->>Admin: Abort with error message
    else Validation Success
        Validator-->>CLI: Spec Validated OK
        CLI->>TxManager: Begin Provisioning Transaction (tenant-acme)
        
        Note over TxManager, K8s: Step 1: Create Namespace Boundary
        TxManager->>K8s: Create Namespace: tenant-acme
        TxManager->>TxManager: Register Compensation Action: delete_namespace("tenant-acme")
        
        Note over TxManager, K8s: Step 2: Apply Self-Contained Tenant Stack
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply ResourceQuota & LimitRange
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply Secrets (Local LiteLLM Master Key + BYOK Provider Keys + LDAPS Credentials)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply ConfigMaps (OpenWebUI Branding + LiteLLM Router Config)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply PersistentVolumeClaim (openwebui-data-pvc)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply NetworkPolicy (Intra-Namespace WebUI<->LiteLLM, LDAPS Egress, Deny Cross-Tenant)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply LiteLLM Deployment & Service (litellm:4000)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply OpenWebUI Deployment & Service (openwebui:8080)
        TxManager->>K8s: Apply Ingress (acme.ai.saasdomain.com)

        Note over TxManager, Cluster: Step 3: Health Verification
        TxManager->>Cluster: Poll Deployment Rollout Readiness (Timeout: 180s)
        alt Pod CrashLoopBackOff / Rollout Timeout
            Cluster-->>TxManager: Readiness Timeout / Admission Error
            Note over TxManager, K8s: Atomic Rollback Execution
            TxManager->>K8s: Delete Namespace tenant-acme (Reclaims all resources)
            TxManager-->>CLI: Transaction Rolled Back
            CLI-->>Admin: Provisioning Failed: Rollback Completed (Zero dangling state)
        else Pods Ready & Passing Probes
            Cluster-->>TxManager: Pods Ready (OpenWebUI 1/1, LiteLLM 1/1)
            TxManager->>TxManager: Commit Transaction & Record Registry
            TxManager-->>CLI: Tenant Stack Successfully Provisioned
            CLI-->>Admin: Success: https://acme.ai.saasdomain.com ready!
        end
    end
